# Sumonity Unity Base

VR cycling research simulator (Unity 2022.3.62f3, TUM): SUMO + TUM campus + bicycle for stress-response experiments. Primary scene: `Assets/Scenes/MainScene.unity`.

Read [docs/PROJECT_MINDMAP.md](docs/PROJECT_MINDMAP.md) before adding systems. Current work notes: [docs/SESSION.md](docs/SESSION.md).

## Two ScenarioManagers — do not mix

- Root `Assets/ScenarioManager.cs` — CSV permutation / HMI (`CommandLineHandler`, `DataLog`)
- `CyclingExperiment.Scenarios.ScenarioManager` — active scenario + Baseline/Stress

## Where to extend

- VR scenarios, AI, HUD: `Assets/Scripts/` (`CyclingExperiment.*`)
- Scene object lookups: serialize on `ExperimentSceneRefs` — do not `Find` / `GetComponent` in gameplay
- Hardware / SUMO bike: `Assets/BicycleSimulatorModel/`, `Assets/Sumonity/`
- Do not edit RCCP / `Assets/CarModel/` unless asked

## Landmines

- Empty submodules: `SumoProject`, `Sim-BusStop`, `Sumonity-Navigation`, `Sumonity-MapInterpreter`
- Build settings reference missing `MainScene_GroupB.unity`
- Root CSV path `Assets/random_seed.csv` is editor-only; some loggers use hardcoded Windows paths
